  "description": "Experience the luxury of living in this wonderful two bedroom apartment located at The Elysian development with spectacular and unrivaled views of Cork City. \n\nThese newly refurbished luxurious apartments have been finished to a very high standard and come fully furnished with custom designed interiors and an impression of seclusion while living in this highly central city centre location. \n\nKey features: \nResidence in Corks most prestigious residential development \nHigh-quality interior design finish and bespoke furnishings throughout \nIntegrated appliances\nGenerous and bright interiors with extensive storage space \nTwo spacious double bedrooms with floor to ceiling fitted wardrobes\nEn-suite bathrooms, main bathroom and WC, all with pump assisted showers\nLarge covered balcony, with South facing views of Cork \nEfficient central heating system with thermostat control \nAir conditioning in living spaces\nWired for phone, cable and broadband services \nSecure underground parking available at an additional cost  \nSecure fob control for resident areas \nFully equipped gym, and business suite\nResident amenity areas\nResident events throughout the year\nDedicated property manager on site full time\nAfter hours management service \nPackage delivery storage services \nOn-site concierge 7 days a week \n\nThe Elysian is a 600m walk from the South Mall & 700m to Patrick Street in Corks city centre. Kent Train Station (Intercity) is located 1km from the development offering links to Limerick and Dublin. There are extensive bus service routes around the city and fast access to the M8 motorway. \n\nTo truly appreciate the uniqueness of this Kennedy Wilson development, viewing is strongly advised. Early mornings and late afternoon viewings are available upon request. For more information on this property and other Kennedy Wilson rental properties and services please contact us. *Please note that photographs are for marketing purposes. Units are similar but the decor may vary.",
